        "testata": "France 24",
        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "US, Iran ceasefire will bring 'relief' but unclear 'what the future holds'",
        "testo_it": "La tregua tra USA e Iran porta sollievo, ma resta incertezza sul futuro delle relazioni diplomatiche.",
        "priorita": "Altissima",
        "id_gruppo": 1,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260408-us-iran-ceasefire-will-bring-relief-but-unclear-what-the-future-holds",
        "orario": "11:53",
        "timestamp": 1775642024,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. US, Iran ceasefire will bring 'relief' but unclear 'what the future holds' Issued on: 08/04/2026 - 11:53 The two-week ceasefire agreed between the US, ISrael and Iran will bring relief for the international community and the Iranian population, Myriam Benraad, professor and Middle East specialist at the University of Exeter, tells France 24. But, with talks now set to take place to negotiate a longer-term peace and given the constradictory messages coming from the White House \"we don't really know what the future holds\", she says. US, Israel and Iran agree to 2-week ceasefire as Trump pulls back on threats 08/04/2026 US-Iran ceasefire ‘a major problem domestically’ for Netanyahu 08/04/2026 Middle East Iran portraying ceasefire as 'victory against the United States and Israel' 08/04/2026 Middle East EU farm fraud scandal rocks Greek government, PM urges swift action 07/04/2026 Europe NASA–ESA partnership: Artemis II paves way for exploring Moon’s far side and south pole 07/04/2026 Science Iran positively reviewing Pakistan’s request for a two-week ceasefire, source says 07/04/2026 Middle East Trump's 'rhetoric itself could create a norm' for others to terrorise entire populations 07/04/2026 Middle East An 'eerie still' in Tehran amid Trump's apocalyptic threats 07/04/2026 Middle East Kanye West refused entry to UK, Wireless Festival cancelled 07/04/2026 Culture"
